                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Once <ITALICS>The Book of Lost Pages</ITALICS> affected them, they took off! I have no idea where in the Spiral you might find them.",
